# The 60-second tour: a public demo app, nothing to sign up for.
# Its todos live in your browser's local storage only.
#   jevb run examples/todomvc.jevb            # human pace: watch with JEVB_HEADED=1
#   jevb run examples/todomvc.jevb --pace agent
open https://demo.playwright.dev/todomvc/
check is an empty todo list with a "What needs to be done?" box shown?
type the new todo box => Buy oat milk
press Enter
type the new todo box => Call the plumber
press Enter
check are "Buy oat milk" and "Call the plumber" both listed, with "2 items left"?
act mark "Buy oat milk" as done
check does the counter say "1 item left"?
act show only the completed todos
check is "Buy oat milk" shown?
refute is "Call the plumber" shown?
act clear the completed todos
act show all todos
check is "Call the plumber" the only todo left?
